/t/p/w780/vjk9E2MHgQhQRdTXt4oDzjVAZnF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u9kHYSlzYpE04KV9AqdG8pBmAKx.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"1966-09-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Dan'l Boone Shot a B'ar\",\"overview\":\"Boone faces a killer bear and the man who has sworn vengeance on the animal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tvrEszDy3F8Qlge4Hs4D3tYORqP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-09-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Allegiances\",\"overview\":\"Mingo struggles with his divided heritage when an Indian council announces the British will help recapture Indian land.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9obMsHN1k5iu2l3dRLPgfWhaaIO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-09-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Goliath\",\"overview\":\"Fearing three vengeful brothers, Otis spends money given to him for draft horses on a husky slave.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iewD0yUaK2mJOVtw6yvsYlGxmfQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-09-29\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Grizzly\",\"overview\":\"Israel helps clear a wild-looking mountain man accused of murdering a man who refused to pay a debt.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yAWCDteyDnPX9p2qtxjV5iedtxe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-10-06\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"First in War, First in Peace\",\"overview\":\"Washington visits in answer to a letter from Boone, who never wrote to him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sY39nLfVosWw7UJVJsRzACnrZiT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-10-13\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Run a Crooked Mile\",\"overview\":\"Israel is taken captive so Boone will help steal a war hero s body and then extort money from the family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AmaAyCgcOKndOna9FD9HzHfEaMV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-10-20\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Matchmaker\",\"overview\":\"Boone and Mingo agree to transport an unwilling Creek princess to an arranged wedding with a Shawnee.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qUASDQ2a1wTBE7ioyHT5uz6ptU0.jpg\",\"rating\":1,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"1966-10-27\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Onatha\",\"overview\":\"Boone employs a mastodon s skeleton to fight two slave traders seeking runaway slaves.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q9ghcQnswW2mMcZZVeEUvEEuCEK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-11-03\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Loser's Race\",\"overview\":\"Daniel and the other settlers in Boonesborough will lose their land if they do not pay a new tax of one shilling per acre within two weeks. As Daniel is about to take the money to Williamsburg an old friend shows up offering to help.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/anAiKv5UMuYyBVBch9ghfTHjzBK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-11-10\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Enchanted Gun\",\"overview\":\"A Shawnee faces danger when he believes in the magic of a gun given to him by Boone for saving Israel s life.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zwzu1ArQByxIZi9rX7r1s740eBU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-11-17\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Requiem for Craw Green\",\"overview\":\"Mingo masquerades as white to help an Indian boy condemned by the bigoted head of a settlement.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ggOxVv5bOhLJbbTYpWQp9XhJ5pC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-12-01\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Lost Colony\",\"overview\":\"A buckskin-clad girl leads Boone to a lost colony of settlers in a valley feared by Indians.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ov0rW7pWQccfuwbiOWRUARkr2G4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-12-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"River Passage\",\"overview\":\"Boone fights a dishonest boatman and Shawnee to deliver gunpowder to Boonesborough.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3EBhTIUjAleP0HOZJpt3CspdSPt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-12-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"When a King Is a Pawn\",\"overview\":\"Boone and Israel foil a plot to grab a French prince and send him back to a revolutionary tribunal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y4XL1zx6EKWr3cR1Mzh3sqs4t9s.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-12-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Symbol\",\"overview\":\"An impoverished nobleman acquires the Liberty Bell and decides to sell it to the British.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/boMDMschvhui6IA4X22FFJdyZFp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1966-12-29\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The Williamsburg Cannon (1)\",\"overview\":\"Virginia's governor, Patrick Henry, assigns Daniel to escort a somewhat nervous artillery captain and his cannon through hostile territory, and the fact that the cannon is large and hard to maneuver is making the journey more difficult.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a8vthYypK0pgFo53DFIGL7gveH4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-01-12\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Williamsburg Cannon (2)\",\"overview\":\"Virginia's governor Patrick Henry assigns Daniel to escort a somewhat nervous artillery captain and his cannon through hostile territory, and the fact that the cannon is large and hard to maneuver is making the journey more difficult.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nhETByxiigdOfzNj0m3bU24TDuI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-01-19\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"The Wolf Man\",\"overview\":\"As Boonesborough awaits a slavery vote, a frontiersman struggles to protect his pet wolf from townspeople.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k50pdv0WsjbPacqixzXCVZeTt7c.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-01-26\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"The Jasper Ledbedder Story\",\"overview\":\"Daniel and Mingo find an old colonist named Jasper Ledbedder who claims that Native Americans abducted his wife and child after his party had a massacre. They agree to help him, even though they suspect his story is not entirely true.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/38hAyCQWwOGSKtq1hlI9OPEHDmy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-02-02\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"When I Became a Man, I Put Away Childish Things\",\"overview\":\"Israel runs away with his pet fawn when Boone says the destructive animal, too tame to set free, must be killed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d7NgalEguiLAmWz8IRXstSI5FN9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-02-09\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"The Long Way Home\",\"overview\":\"Boone sets out to recapture a prisoner, an educated black accused of murdering an Indian chief.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cr0ZhIOFKZsLXR2c1Mzs1DnvHN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-02-16\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"The Young Ones\",\"overview\":\"An orphan, determined to keep his family together, causes trouble for rescuer Boone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Xd2Lmlz1sF22eTYc1cf3lYHRQh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-02-23\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Delo Jones\",\"overview\":\"A fugitive from Virginia, Delo Jones, comes to Boonesborough ahead of a British contingent determined to arrest him for a murder. Daniel believes he may be innocent and plans a trap to catch the real killer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gkAhgjm8JCA0E8vE2CDjmpfbTQw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-03-02\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"The Necklace\",\"overview\":\"A dying man confesses to murder and theft, producing a pearl necklace as proof, and tells of the innocent man to be hanged for his crimes. Against townsfolks' wishes, Daniel takes the necklace to New Orleans to secure the freedom of the accused man.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jkdk9NqGlZe642F71hh31VyuaEd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-03-09\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Fort West Point\",\"overview\":\"Boone and Mingo try to stop the commandant of West Point from selling the fort to the British.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ym6Go5Tm8MTUyfX8R6tHNouNecV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-03-23\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Bitter Mission\",\"overview\":\"A traitor's plan to profit from war with the Spanish backfires.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mtoUjRxS39uYO8vjb1tReOKFgNS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-03-30\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Take the Southbound Stage\",\"overview\":\"Rebecca decides to help Boone rescue President John Adams from kidnappers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dfRJYTZhf70stGzp54R8IC3fdLK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-04-06\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"The Fallow Land\",\"overview\":\"After fur-trappers break a treaty, a Cherokee chief s hotheaded son tries to start a war.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bLMnh0WoSFTt3lmwUrcEIdiHO9x.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1967-04-13\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"1964-09-24\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}